選 **「From a manifest」**——我已經知道完整需要的權限和事件設定,直接貼一份 manifest 進去比手動一頁一頁勾選更不容易漏掉東西(比「Blank app」快,也比「AI agent」「Starter app」乾淨,那兩個會帶一堆我們用不到的預設功能)。

點選後應該會讓你選 JSON 或 YAML,貼這份 JSON:

```json
{
  "display_information": {
    "name": "Light的影分身"
  },
  "features": {
    "bot_user": {
      "display_name": "Light的影分身",
      "always_online": true
    }
  },
  "oauth_config": {
    "scopes": {
      "bot": [
        "chat:write",
        "im:write",
        "im:history",
        "channels:history",
        "groups:history",
        "users:read"
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "event_subscriptions": {
      "bot_events": [
        "message.channels",
        "message.groups",
        "message.im"
      ]
    },
    "interactivity": {
      "is_enabled": false
    },
    "org_deploy_enabled": false,
    "socket_mode_enabled": true,
    "token_rotation_enabled": false
  }
}
```

貼完建立後,流程接著是:

1. 左側選單 **Basic Information** → 往下找 **App-Level Tokens** → **Generate Token and Scopes**,加 `connections:write` scope,產生後複製 `xapp-...`
2. 左側選單 **Install App** → Install to Workspace → 複製 **Bot User OAuth Token**(`xoxb-...`)
3. 把 bot 邀進你要監控的頻道:`/invite @Light的影分身`
4. 複製你自己的 member ID(大頭貼 → More → Copy member ID)

拿到 `xoxb-...`、`xapp-...`、member ID 這三個之後就可以照原本說的跑 `setup_credentials.py`。

`bot_user.display_name` 需要能轉成合法的 Slack username(不支援中文),但 `display_information.name`(App 顯示名稱)可以是中文,那個沒有報錯。把 bot_user 的 display_name 改成英數字就好:

```json
{
  "display_information": {
    "name": "Light的影分身"
  },
  "features": {
    "bot_user": {
      "display_name": "light-shadow-clone",
      "always_online": true
    }
  },
  "oauth_config": {
    "scopes": {
      "bot": [
        "chat:write",
        "im:write",
        "im:history",
        "channels:history",
        "groups:history",
        "users:read"
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "event_subscriptions": {
      "bot_events": [
        "message.channels",
        "message.groups",
        "message.im"
      ]
    },
    "interactivity": {
      "is_enabled": false
    },
    "org_deploy_enabled": false,
    "socket_mode_enabled": true,
    "token_rotation_enabled": false
  }
}
```

App 本身在 Slack 裡顯示的名字還是會是「Light的影分身」(`display_information.name`),`display_name` 只是內部 bot user 的 username slug,不影響你們看到的顯示效果。整段貼進去應該就不會再報錯了。

